OL,3,GNEWSAAward for police dog who had to
OL,4,Aretire through injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former West Midlands Police dog,
OL,7,Fforced into retirement through injury,
OL,8,Fis to get a lifetime achievement award
OL,9,Ffrom a charity that supports retired
OL,10,Fpolice dogs.
OL,12,FCaptain is being recognised by the Thin
OL,13,FBlue Paw Foundation, four years after
OL,14,Fleaving the force.
OL,16,FThe German Shepherd ruptured a cruciate
OL,17,Fligament in 2021, which saw an end to
OL,18,Fhis career and then went on to have
OL,19,Fmajor spinal surgery, which cost
OL,20,F#30,000.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
