OL,3,GNEWSAAward for police dog who had to
OL,4,Aretire through injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FKieran Stanbridge, who founded the
OL,7,Fcharity in 2020, said "His resilience
OL,8,Fas a serving dog and in retirement is
OL,9,Fwhy he's being celebrated this year as
OL,10,Four Lifetime Achievement winner."
